# API & Auth

## Client
- Base client: `src/lib/api/client.ts` → `api.get/post/put/delete`
- Endpoints are paths like `/products`, `/login` (prefixed by `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`)
- Transform API shapes in `transformers.ts`; keep UI types in `@/types`

## Auth
- NextAuth credentials provider in `src/lib/auth.ts`
- Login response shape: `{ user, token }` (not wrapped in `.data`)
- Session exposes `accessToken` for authenticated API calls

## Do not change unless asked
- API URL, auth flow, or server route handlers under `src/app/api/`
- Do not point login at `/admin/login` (Filament UI, GET only)

## Errors
- Use `ApiError` from client; surface Persian messages in UI toasts where appropriate

## Query keys
- Define in `src/hooks/queries/*/query-keys.ts`
- Example: `cartKeys.lists()` — use existing factory methods, do not invent missing keys
